constraints:
1 ≤ n ≤ 10^{18}

expected time complexity: O(log(n))
expected auxiliary space: O(1)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def largePrime(self, n):
		i = 2
		d = {}
		while i * i <= n:
			while n % i == 0:
				if i in d:
					d[i] += 1
				else:
					d[i] = 1
				n = n // i
			i += 1
		if n > 1:
			if n in d:
				d[n] += 1
			else:
				d[n] = 1
		if d == {}:
			return 0
		if d[max(d)] > 1:
			return 1
		return 0
